" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-line top-line-none is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Does Discord Nitro include Xbox Game Pass?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>Yes. Nitro members get access to Xbox Game Pass (Starter Edition), which includes a library of 50+ games across PC and console, plus 10 hours of cloud gaming every month. It’s included with your Nitro membership at no additional cost. Availability varies by region. Visit your Nitro Home to get started.</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-line top-line-none is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">What are Nitro Rewards?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>Nitro Rewards is a benefits program included with your Nitro membership that gives you access to gaming services, gear discounts, and perks from partners like Xbox, Logitech, and SteelSeries. We&#x27;re always exploring new partners and aim to bring you more of what you love as this program evolves.</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">How does Nitro work?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>When you subscribe to Nitro, you get access to features that were previously locked for you - like using custom emoji anywhere, uploading bigger files, setting a custom video background, and more. When the subscription ends, you’ll lose access to the perks. </p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">What’s the difference between Nitro and Nitro Basic?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>Nitro is our most popular plan that unlocks access to all available Nitro perks, and Nitro Basic includes a selection of the most-loved Nitro perks that help you better express yourself. See the comparison chart above for a full breakdown! </p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">How much does Nitro cost?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>Cost varies depending on your country and plan. You can check Nitro prices under User Settings &gt; Nitro in either the desktop or mobile apps.</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Where can I buy Nitro?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>You can purchase Nitro by visiting the Nitro tab in User Settings, or in the Nitro page under Home on desktop. On mobile, visit User Settings by tapping your user icon in the bottom bar, then select Get Nitro.</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="faq-block bottom-none"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-line top-line-none w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">What payment methods do you accept?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>We accept a variety of payment methods, which you can learn more info on <a href="https://support.discord.com/hc/articles/360017693772" class="link-16px">here</a>!</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Do you offer Nitro and Nitro Basic in localized pricing?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>We are constantly working to expand the availability of localized pricing for Nitro and Nitro Basic. Check <a href="https://support.discord.com/hc/articles/4407269525911" class="link-16px">this article</a> for information on where localized pricing is currently available.</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="faq-block bottom-none"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-line top-line-none w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Are Nitro gifts real?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>Yes! You can purchase a Nitro gift through the Nitro page on desktop or the Nitro Gifting tab within mobile under User Settings. Additionally, you can send a quick gift in a channel by selecting the gift icon on desktop or mobile. If someone sends you a gift, you can see what it looks like <a href="https://support.discord.com/hc/articles/360020877112" class="link-16px">here</a>. You can also buy Discord Nitro directly on <a href="http://amazon.com/" target="_blank">Amazon.com</a> (in select regions).</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-line top-line-none w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Does Discord offer gift cards?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>Digital gift cards are available in the US at select retailers, and we have more cooking. Check out our <a href="https://discord.com/gift-cards" target="_blank">gift cards page</a> or our <a href="https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/41159820367895" target="_blank">Help Center</a> for more information. Looking for where to redeem? <a href="https://discord.com/redeem" target="_blank">Head here!</a> </p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Where to redeem Nitro codes?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>You can redeem your Nitro code on the desktop and web apps through the Gift Inventory page in User Settings. </p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-line top-line-none w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Can I get free Nitro from a bot or a giveaway?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>The only official way to receive Nitro is through a <a href="https://support.discord.com/hc/articles/360020877112" class="link-16px">gift</a> sent to you in chat, or by receiving a code that can be redeemed under Gift Inventory in User Settings on the desktop and web apps. We strongly encourage not clicking on any links from people you don’t know well. For more tips on staying safe on Discord, visit our <a href="https://discord.com/safetycenter" class="link-16px">Safety</a> page.</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Does Discord offer Nitro Promotions?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>We are always working on ways to give you more with Nitro! Keep an eye out in the app, on our <a href="https://twitter.com/discord" class="link-16px">X</a> , <a href="https://www.instagram.com/discord" class="link-16px">Instagram</a>, or <a href="https://discord.com/blog" class="link-16px">blog</a> to see when new promotions go live. :)</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="faq-block bottom-none"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-line top-line-none w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">My Nitro subscription comes with Boosts. What are those?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>Server Boosts are a way to show support for your favorite communities. Each Boost that you give to a server helps collectively unlock perks for everyone in the server to enjoy. Learn more about Server Boosting <a href="https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360028038352-Server-Boosting-FAQ">here</a>! </p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Are Boosts permanent?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>A Nitro subscription only comes with 2 Boosts that you can share to any server you belong to. The Boosts do not stack over time, and they are not permanent. You’ll get to keep the Boosts for as long as your Nitro subscription is active.</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line is-new w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk is-nitro is-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body-text-new--xll text-weight-medium">Why is my Nitro not working?</div><div class="icons-absol"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list is-new w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk is-new w-richtext"><p>If you’re having any trouble with your subscription, or have any questions, you can <a href="https://dis.gd/billing" class="link-16px">reach out</a> to our team and we’ll be happy to help!</p></div><div class="padding-32px is-48 m-32"></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/67f4f0cb486742a196787182_Chevron%20Down.svg" loading="lazy" width="14" alt="" class="arrow-drop-nitro is-grey"/></div><div class="w-embed"><style>
